config MTK_MIR3DA
	bool "MiraMEMS MIR3DA accelerometer"
	depends on CUSTOM_KERNEL_ACCELEROMETER
	depends on I2C=y
	depends on MTK_SENSORS_1_0
	default n
	help
	  MiraMEMS NSA-family accelerometer (DA380 class, WHO_AM_I 0x13) on the
	  MediaTek sensors-1.0 framework, the vendor reference driver.  It
	  binds the mediatek,gsensor_mir3da node; on k50sv1_64_bsp that node
	  says 0x26 while the part answers at 0x27, which the driver's probe
	  handles the way the shipped kernel does.
